glyph ($0..9)-circled
ref enclosing-circle
ref ($0..9) 4 0
glyph ($1..4**10)($0..9)-circled
ref enclosing-circle-bg
ref ($1..4**10)-4x10 4 3
ref ($0..9)-4x10 9 3
glyph 50-circled
ref enclosing-circle-bg
ref 5-4x10 4 3
ref 0-4x10 9 3

glyph ($0..9)-circled-half
ref enclosing-circle-half
ref ($0..9)-3x8 3 4
glyph ($1..4**10)($0..9)-circled-half
ref enclosing-circle-bg-half
ref ($1..4**10)-3x8 1 4
ref ($0..9)-3x8 4 4
glyph 50-circled-half
ref enclosing-circle-bg-half
ref 5-3x8 1 4
ref 0-3x8 4 4

map wide|narrow : ⓪|①|②|③|④|⑤|⑥|⑦|⑧|⑨ = ($0..9)-circled($-half)
map wide|narrow : ⑩|⑪|⑫|⑬|⑭|⑮|⑯|⑰|⑱|⑲ = 1($0..9)-circled($-half)
map wide|narrow : ⑳|㉑|㉒|㉓|㉔|㉕|㉖|㉗|㉘|㉙ = 2($0..9)-circled($-half)
map wide|narrow : ㉚|㉛|㉜|㉝|㉞|㉟|㊱|㊲|㊳|㊴ = 3($0..9)-circled($-half)
map wide|narrow : ㊵|㊶|㊷|㊸|㊹|㊺|㊻|㊼|㊽|㊾ = 4($0..9)-circled($-half)
map wide|narrow : ㊿ = 50-circled($-half)

glyph ($a-z)-upper-circled
ref enclosing-circle
ref ($a-z)-upper 4 0
glyph ($a-z)-lower-circled
ref enclosing-circle
ref ($a-z)-lower

glyph ($a-z)-upper-circled-half
ref enclosing-circle-bg-half
ref narrow-($a-z)-upper 1 0
glyph ($a-z)-lower-circled-half
ref enclosing-circle-bg-half
ref narrow-($a-z)-lower 1 0

map wide|narrow : Ⓐ|Ⓑ|Ⓒ|Ⓓ|Ⓔ|Ⓕ|Ⓖ|Ⓗ|Ⓘ|Ⓙ|Ⓚ|Ⓛ|Ⓜ|Ⓝ|Ⓞ|Ⓟ|Ⓠ|Ⓡ|Ⓢ|Ⓣ|Ⓤ|Ⓥ|Ⓦ|Ⓧ|Ⓨ|Ⓩ = ($a-z)-upper-circled($-half)
map wide|narrow : ⓐ|ⓑ|ⓒ|ⓓ|ⓔ|ⓕ|ⓖ|ⓗ|ⓘ|ⓙ|ⓚ|ⓛ|ⓜ|ⓝ|ⓞ|ⓟ|ⓠ|ⓡ|ⓢ|ⓣ|ⓤ|ⓥ|ⓦ|ⓧ|ⓨ|ⓩ = ($a-z)-lower-circled($-half)

